{"slug":"Universal-Script-Universal-Roblox-Chat-86542","_id":"696aa6a0107151476e78a97b","title":"[FIXED Link 21-07-26]Universal Roblox Chat","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Features:\nWorks Everywhere – Truly universal; use it in any game you want.\n\nSmart UI – Automatically detects if you are on Mobile or PC and adjusts the size perfectly.\n\nMobile Support – Optimized touch controls and custom \"Tap to Chat\" placeholder for mobile users.\n\nAuto-Translation Engine – Real-time detection of incoming messages with toggleable auto-translate to your local language using /toggle and /lang [ISO].\n\nBuilt-in Command Menu – Use /commands to see the full list of available features, shortcuts, and settings instantly.\n\nCustom Color System – Use /color [name] to change your chat and bubble color instantly with high-quality hex syncing.\n\nBubble Chat – Full TextChatService integration. Messages show up over your head with RichText color support.\n\nEcho & Delay – Use /echo [1-60s] [msg] for timed messages, or /clearecho to cancel them instantly.\n\nAuthentic Colors – Usernames use the official Roblox algorithm for unique, recognizable colors.\n\nTranslated Alerts – Get a \"Joined Channel\" notification in your own language as soon as you connect.\n\nLag Free – Optimized message logging and smooth scrolling to keep your game running fast.\n\nCopy Feature – Just click the \"Copy\" button next to any message to grab the text instantly.\n\nClear Chat – A big, easy button to wipe the log whenever it gets too full.\n\nSlash To Talk – Hit '/' to start typing on PC, exactly like the standard Roblox chat.\n*Note:* I tested this script in this game, https://www.roblox.com/games/123974602339071/Just-a-baseplate\n*Additional Note:* \nThis only works when other players have the script executed. For example, if Player 1 and Player 2 both have the script, they can see each other's chat, but nobody else in the server will see it.","tags":["Global Chat","Universal Chat"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/breezipsettings-max/72ca471e89dc03b07d4d74142ff758fe/raw/138550edb3ae094411bc91c6889f0cebc2d5f4a7/CHAT%2520ROBLOX.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6882c9dae6f69d3860174167","username":"breezipsettings","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lvl":8,"status":"offline","id":"6882c9dae6f69d3860174167","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"verified":false,"views":2417,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3e1d586ecfec41d7d621596ec88b3c6cef458b2e51fda45cab9050a6b9687751.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1768597152502.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1768597152502.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-01-16T20:59:12.513Z","editBy":{"_id":"6882c9dae6f69d3860174167","username":"breezipsettings","status":"offline","id":"6882c9dae6f69d3860174167"},"keyLink":"","executes":608,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-17T02:07:28.454Z","last":"","win":14,"math":2},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3e1d586ecfec41d7d621596ec88b3c6cef458b2e51fda45cab9050a6b9687751.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1768597152502.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1768597152502.png"},"changelog":[{"_id":"696aa6a0107151476e78a97e","editBy":{"_id":"6882c9dae6f69d3860174167","username":"breezipsettings","status":"of